2. VOCABULARY DATA (src/data/core.json)

Dutch A1+A2 core vocabulary (zh), based on NT2Lex
(Tack et al. 2018, https://github.com/anaistack/NT2Lex), plus hand-added
entries. IPA generated with eSpeak NG, partly corrected by hand.

Licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

- Attribution: credit NT2Lex (Tack et al. 2018) when you reuse the data.
